{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Birch Dresser is a piece of ",["l","家具","furniture"],". It can rotate into daily stock at the ",["l","木匠的商店","Carpenter's Shop"]," for 5,000g or the ",["l","旅行货车","Traveling Cart"]," for between 250–2,500g."]],["p",["It's also available from the ",["l","家具目录","Furniture Catalogue"]," for 0g."]],["p",["It can be used to store ",["l","衣服","clothing"],", ",["l","帽子","hats"],", ",["l","鞋类","shoes"],", and ",["l","戒指","rings"],"."]],["g",[["Dresser_with_tabs.png",200,["Dresser storage"]]]]]]]}